 527:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/aes.c ****  * Note that the offset is in units of elements of buf, i.e. 32-bit words,
 528:../../bos/thirdparty/mbedtls/bos_mbedtls/aes.c ****  * i.e. an offset of 1 means 4 bytes and so on.
